All 18 events!
Registration will be closed at midnight on September, 17 or when we reach 250 competitors.
Spectators are welcome and do not need to register or pay.

Registration fee:

* **150 RUB**(~2.3 USD) for any one event (for ex. 3x3x3 Cube only) (or 100 RUB using prepayment);
* **250 RUB** (~3.9 USD) for equal or less than 8 events (or 200 RUB using prepayment);;
* **350 RUB** (~5.4 USD) for 9 - 18 events (or 300 RUB using prepayment);;

If you do not see your name on the compeitors table after 48 hours of registering, please [contact us](mailto:ruslan.chaika@mail.ru,robota.av@gmail.com) to resolve the issue.

Visit the competition [website](https://vk.com/belgorodopen2018) for more details.

All 18 events!
Registration will be closed at midnight on October, 4 or when we reach 200 competitors.
Spectators are welcome and do not need to register or pay. 

Registration fee:
* **FREE** for students of Belgorod University of Cooperation, Economy and Law;
* **100 RUB**(~2 USD) for any one event (for ex. Rubik's Cube only);
* **200 RUB** (~4 USD) for equal or less than 10 events;
* **+10 RUB** for earch event more 10; (for ex. 280 RUB for 18 events);

If you do not see your name on the compeitors table after 48 hours of registering, please [contact us](mailto:ruslan.chaika@mail.ru,robota.av@gmail.com) to resolve the issue.

Visit the competition [website](https://vk.com/belgorodopen2017) for more details.

The registration is free, maximum number of competitors is 130.
Please give us as soon as possible the exact number of guests coming with you **and their names.**

There is a restriction on the registration to the following events, you can only chose 3 out of these 6 events : 
- 6x6 cube; 
- 7x7 cube; 
- Rubik's Clock; 
- 4x4 blindfolded; 
- 5x5 blindfolded, 
- 3x3 multiple blindfolded.

If you register for more than 3 of these events, your registration may be deleted if you don't answer us.
Due to venue restriction we expect the maximum number of competitors to be reached. If this number is reached, and since the competition is free, we will ask you to confirm your registration some weeks before the competition. If you don't answer this email your registration may be deleted.

Please register only if you are sure to come: keep in mind that not showing up to the competition may prevent someone else from competing!
